at commit 5a3a08662c25bd792043f8a8fb48e4be12099beb.
https://github.com/MiSTer-devel/Main_MiSTer
The candidate stages the committed source, preserves its source headers and
LICENSE, and retains third-party library licenses in the full build tree.

The per-core launch-context reader uses SXMLC version 4.2.7, Copyright (c) 2010
Matthieu Labas, under its BSD two-clause license. vendor/sxmlc contains sxmlc.c and sxmlc.h from the same pinned Main commit, exact file hashes and the
original license. Printing helpers use explicit literal-string format
