is neither linked nor replaced. See licenses/sxmlc/LICENSE.

The statically linked TIC-80 runtime and optional console/editors originate from nesbox/TIC-80 at commit
4dba5bc2640d9cde650fb0b427c9be6aab598de9 and retains its MIT license.
https://github.com/nesbox/TIC-80
